27	/**
28	 * Unpacks and validates page parameters and search parameters for the footy
29	 * table page.
30	 *
31	 * This function validates the table name parameter against the TableNameSchema,
32	 * validates the year search parameter, and ensures the year exists in the
33	 * available years. It also handles canonical URL redirects to ensure consistent
34	 * URL formatting.
35	 *
36	 * @param params - The page route parameters containing the table name
37	 * @param searchParams - The URL search parameters, optionally containing a year
38	 * @returns A promise resolving to an object containing the validated table
